          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Form</span><span class="info-stat-val">Narrative poem in Tuscan of 14,233 lines of eleven syllables in terza rima, in three cantiche, Inferno, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/purgatorio">Purgatorio</a> and Paradiso, of 33 cantos each, with an opening canto making 100</span></div>
